<!-- partials.services.web-design.web-design-keys -->
<section class="keys customContainer">
    <h2>Keys to Ultimate Web Design</h2>
    <h6>“Design is thinking made visual.” (Saul Bass)</h6>
    <p>Our experience has taught us that in order to provide the ultimate web design that puts our clients ahead of the competition, we must deliver on these promises:</p>
    <article class="keys-cards">
        <div class="card">
            <div>
                <img src="/assets/images/services/web-design-img/Visual appeal.svg" alt="Visual appeal icon">
                <h3>Visual appeal</h3>
            </div>
            <p>You have one chance to make a first impression. As soon as your future customers land on your web pages, they assess your company’s credibility and product quality. Alpha Efficiency will ensure your web design captures your website visitors’ attention and encourages them to explore your site.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div>
                <img src="/assets/images/services/web-design-img/Ease of Use.svg" alt="Ease of use icon">
                <h3>Ease of Use</h3>
            </div>
            <p>If your users can’t navigate your website with ease, they will be quick to revert to your competitors. Don’t allow yourself to lose customers due to a poor website structure. Our <a href="/web-development-agency-chicago">web development agency Chicago</a> creates intuitive and easy-to-navigate websites allowing your users to find everything they are looking for with a click of a button.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div>
                <img src="/assets/images/services/web-design-img/High-quality content.svg" alt="High-quality content icon">
                <h3>High-quality content</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Your website has to be more than a pretty-looking facade. The ultimate web design includes compelling content with clear CTA. Our web design experts will ensure that your content is created and optimized with your business goals in mind.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div>
                <img src="/assets/images/services/web-design-img/High conversion rates.svg" alt="High conversion rates icon">
                <h3>High conversion rates</h3>
            </div>
            <p>We will communicate with your team to determine your website’s CTA. Whether it’s to submit a lead form, schedule a call, purchase a product, or subscribe to a service, we will tailor an entire web design process around that goal to ensure every aspect closely aligns with your business philosophy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div>
                <img src="/assets/images/services/web-design-img/Business growth.svg" alt="Business growth icon">
                <h3>Business growth</h3>
            </div>
            <p>At Alpha Efficiency, we deliver scalable websites that support your plans for growth and expansion.</p>
        </div>
    </article>
    <h5>Thirsty for more? Find out everything you wanted about Web Design at our <a href="/category/web-design">Web Design Blog</a> </h5>
</section>

